  | NODE_BIT_CTYPE | NODE_BIT_ANCHOR | NODE_BIT_BAG | NODE_BIT_QUANT \
  | NODE_BIT_CALL | NODE_BIT_BACKREF | NODE_BIT_GIMMICK)

